cl inlines size_of away and emits no symbol for it, so there is nothing on its side to compare - the diff is one line, cxx1's name with no answering line from cl, and not two spellings disagreeing. Same reason local-class.nocl and local-class-main.nocl record. The name itself is measured: clang for this ABI writes ??$size_of@UL@?1??main@@9@@@YAHUL@?1??main@@9@@Z, character for character what cxx1 writes, and names.sh checks that on the Mac for all three ABIs
